      <h2 class="CH"><a name="7.03"></a>CHAPTER 7-03<br />CITY WATER SYSTEM REGULATIONS</h2>
            <p class="digCH">SECTIONS:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff07/Flagstaff0703000.html#7.03.001.0001">7-03-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;APPLICATION FOR CONNECTION</p>

